pplicable", "Case Door Orientation Is Not Applicable", "Case Return Line Diameter Is Not Applicable", "Compressor Unloader Is Not Applicable", "Compressor Unloader Number Of Stages Is Not Applicable", "Condenser Plant ID Is Not Applicable", "Crankcase Heater Is Not Applicable", "Defrosting Type Is Not Applicable", "Desuperheat Valve Is Not Applicable", "Door Configuration Is Not Applicable", "Evaporation Pressure Regulators Is Not Applicable", "Lamp Power Is Not Applicable", "Location Is Not Applicable", "Manufacturer Is Not Applicable", "Model Number Is Not Applicable", "Net Refrigeration Cpacity Is Not Applicable", "Number of Refrigerant Return Lines Is Not Applicable", "Primary Fuel Is Not Applicable", "Quantity Is Not Applicable", "Refrigerant Is Not Applicable", "Refrigerant Subcooler Is Not Applicable", "Refrigerated Case Doors Is Not Applicable", "Refrigeration Compressor Is Not Applicable", "Refrigeration Compressor Type Is Not Applicable", "Refrigeration Energy Is Not Applicable", "Refrigeration System Name Is Not Applicable", "Refrigeration System Name", "Refrigeration System Notes Is Not Applicable", "Refrigeration System Notes", "Refrigeration System Type Is Not Applicable", "Refrigeration Unit Size Is Not Applicable", "Refrigeration Unit Type Is Not Applicable", "Suction Vapor Temperature Is Not Applicable", "Total Year Rejection Is Not Applicable", "Year Installed Is Not Applicable", or "Year Of Manufacture Is Not Applicable"</sch:assert>
